      "id": "alfosc_report_readout_speeds",
      "question": "What are the four readout speeds provided by the ALFOSC detector controller (CCD3) introduced in 2011?",
      "answer": "Historical/technical report (not current operating guidance): The new detector controller provides 4 different speeds (113, 200, 400 and 800 kpix/sec), where the 200 kpix/sec speed was specifically defined in the user requirements. Most of the tests and results given below refer to those obtained with the 200 kpix/sec speed using amplifier A which we have adopted for the moment as the standard readout speed. [D-8bbaf408407c876c-C2]",
